Rules:
- affected: true only when the player's declared action is explicitly applying a buff
  (casting mage armor, drinking a potion of healing, activating rage, etc.).
- If affected: needs_mechanics is always true (the mechanical evaluation will identify
  the buff source and emit a buffs_add mutation — no dice roll needed).
- If the player is attacking, moving, talking, or doing anything other than applying a buff:
  affected false.

Output JSON only:
{
  "affected": false,
  "needs_mechanics": false,
  "macro_significant": false,
  "expand_scene": false,
  "transition": null,
  "destination": null,
  "combatants": [],
  "reasoning": "1 sentence"
}
